  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="31">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Grith">Grið</ref> 31</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And þonne is rihtlic eac þæt ure ælce oðerne healde mid rihte, and þæt ælc cyrice sy æfre on Godes ealmihtiges griðe and on ealles Cristenes folces.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And then it is also right that each of us treat one another with justice, and that every church be ever in the protection of God almighty and of all Christian people.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">7 þonne is rihtlic eac, þæt ure ælce oðerne healde mid rihte, 7 þæt ælc cyrice sy æfre on Godes ealmihtiges griðe 7 on ealles Cristenes folces.</ab>
      </div>
